  "releaseNotes": "Fixed issue with default column formatting in XLSX reader.\nAdded support for time number formats in ODS files.\nFixed issue with culture dependant number values in XLSB writer.\nAdded support for ExcelChart.RefreshCache method.\nFixed issue with relative column references in XLSB reader.\nFixed issue with null result values in calculation engine.\nAdded support for HtmlLoadOptions.StyleMediaType.\nFixed issue with mission OLE stream in XLSX reader.\nAdded support for PV, NPER, and EFFECT functions.\nFixed issue with chart axis line positioning and size.\nFixed issue with invalid cell reference in XLSX reader.",
